      "Original": "Crap. You're right.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_01_00_Novel_00081_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Commander Tezuka with a side of Cancer.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_01_00_Novel_00082_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "They'd be unstoppable. Nothing would come close to standing in their way.",
